# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec
#  packaging/SeizureReview.spec is hand-written source, not generated. It is the
#  definition of the shipped application — losing it would mean the build could
#  not be reproduced.
!packaging/*.spec

